OL,3,GNEWSAFamily asks law firm to
OL,4,Ainvestigate blaze that killed two
OL,5,Asisters
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of two sisters who died in a
OL,8,Fflat fire in Aberdeen two years ago
OL,9,Fhave asked a law firm to help a search
OL,10,Ffor answers about the blaze
OL,12,FShikshya and Aanchal Subedi, who were
OL,13,F24 and 28, died after the fire spread
OL,14,Ffrom a neighbouring flat at the block
OL,15,Fin the city's Back Hilton Road.
OL,17,FA joint police and fire investigation
OL,18,Fwas launched into the blaze in January
OL,19,F2024, but there were no suspicious
OL,20,Fcircumstances found.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
